 ## Background
-MTL-FeatureNet was introduced in the context of 3D reconstruction of toys using adaptive scaled neural radiation fields [S1]. It was proposed to address the challenges of high complexity scenes and complex lighting conditions by combining adaptive scale adjustment with spectral perception [S1]. The method is part of an improved NeRF model that enhances detail-rich 3D visual content generation [S1].
